-- <msg:3> helper (html)
   | <!-- codex-helper-outbox:<marker> --><p><strong>🔧 Helper:</strong></p>
   | <p><strong>🔔 Workflow webhook</strong></p>
   | <p>Use this to send Teams Workflow notification cards for important helper events.</p>
   | <p>Commands:</p>
   | <ul><li><code>helper webhook setup</code> - show the setup steps</li>
   | <li><code>helper webhook &lt;https-url&gt;</code> - save and enable the webhook</li>
   | <li><code>helper webhook test</code> - send one test card</li>
   | <li><code>helper webhook status</code> - show whether it is enabled</li>
   | <li><code>helper webhook off</code> - disable cards</li>
   | </ul>
   | <p>The webhook URL is stored locally as a private secret file and is not echoed back.</p>
